"P1500284269" "You need to help the Security Chief in Founders' Falls.  Now!"
// AcceptString :
"P56182900" "Help the Founders' Falls Security Chief"
// SendOffString :
"P4013108846" "I am not sure what is going on, but he said to send help fast."

